<title>CHINA: Heilongjiang Power issues new B shares.</title>
<headline>Heilongjiang Power issues new B shares.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heilongjiang Electric Power Co sold 80 million B shares in a private placement of newly issued stock after the Shanghai stock exchange closed on Wednesday, the Shanghai Securities News said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
